00:03:21.728 --> 00:03:24.270
Are some of the developments,
specifically in the open source

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.840
community that we've partnered
with pharmaceuticals,

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:32.550
the companies to bring to
really support the workflows

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.320
