R Markdown that's actually

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:44.790
helpful throughout the journey
of creating hypotheses,

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.420
collaborating and sharing.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.830
So we're going to spend
some time looking at that.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.030
There's new packages for
the middle layer of work

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:56.120
