00:04:39.417 --> 00:04:41.250
We'll start with those
validation documents

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.020
I mentioned.

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:47.180
These are documents that
outline for packages that

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.740
are affiliated with RStudio.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:53.520
So things like Shiny and R
Markdown, tidyverse, tidy models,

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.380
as well as RStudio Team,
